      "message": "The would be a bitset of enum:\nI2C_CONFIG_SLAVE | ..USE_48MHZ_CLOCK_.... \n\nIf we put the bit for slave/master in the addr(we don\u0027t use it often), then we are back to clean enums.",
      "revId": "ae98412d19524639dac96243d4f26f8175c95f66",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
